Data

The data come from the Higher Education Research and Development (HERD)
Survey, conducted by the National Center for Science and Engineering
Statistics (NCSES) at the U.S. National Science Foundation. The source
files are public, institution-level microdata published by NCSES:
https://ncses.nsf.gov/explore-data/microdata/higher-education-research-development

HERD Explorer reshapes and combines those files but does not change the
reported values. NCSES is not responsible for this project, and errors in
the reshaping are this project's own. Report them at
https://github.com/nate-layman/herd-explorer/issues

